      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  05/08/2000 BY: KIM DINH 
      *           DESC: ADD CURR-EFF-DT TO ALL QUERIES THAT ACCESS IIST001
      *                 IIST002 TABLES.
      *          
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  03/04/99 BY:   JOHN CUSUMANO
      *           DESC: RACE - VERSIONING 
